Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 13:28:55 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 35/38] VICTORY_PIPELINE_WAIT_EARLY_MS: a pipeline's first draw
 waits for it while early pipelines are queued (dark-cell fix)

Round 9b: the dark cell comes from host pipelines missing from the NVIDIA
driver's shader cache (first run of a new build, or the ~1 GB cache's
cleanup): each early pipeline then takes the driver 1-5 s, the early queue
needs minutes, the world starts meanwhile and its first passes are dropped
(PIPELINE_WAIT_MS=0). With the switch, the first draw/dispatch asking for a
pipeline not made yet waits up to <ms> for it (once per pipeline) while the
early list is still queued. Off unless set.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

Kit-Source: own (dark-cell fix, step 1)
Kit-Licence: GPL-3.0
---
 crates/victory-gpu/src/pipeline/make.rs | 84 ++++++++++++++++++-------
 1 file changed, 61 insertions(+), 23 deletions(-)

